{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows远程复制文件到隐藏共享。对应需求：横向移动。官方：Remote File Copy to a Hidden Share。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows远程复制文件到隐藏共享","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows远程复制文件到隐藏共享\n\n### 为何重要\n向其他主机扩散\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/hunting-for-lateral-movement-using-event-query-language"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"fa01341d-6662-426b-9d0c-6d81e33c8a9d","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 横向移动","来源: 默认","对应需求: 横向移动"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and user.id != \"S-1-5-18\" and\n  process.name : (\"cmd.exe\", \"powershell.exe\") and\n  process.command_line : \"*\\\\\\\\*\\\\*$*\" and process.command_line : (\"* copy*\", \"* move*\", \"* cp *\", \"* mv *\")\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1021.002","name":"SMB/Windows Admin Shares","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/002/"}]},{"id":"T1570","name":"Lateral Tool Transfer","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1570/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1074","name":"Data Staged","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1074/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1074.002","name":"Remote Data Staging","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1074/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0009","name":"Collection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0009/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":321,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
